  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere (Combat Juggling), Perform (any) ranks 5.</p>\n<p>You increase the number of objects you can juggle by an amount equal to your operative ability modifier.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you can juggle creatures up to one size category smaller than you. A creature three size categories smaller than you is treated as one object, a creature two size categories smaller than you is treated as two objects, and a creature one size category smaller than you is treated as three objects. If the creature is unwilling, it requires a successful grapple maneuver made as a standard action, although you can substitute your Perform ranks in a package’s associated skill for your base attack bonus while doing so.</p>\n<p>While you are juggling a creature, any single-target attacks that target you or a juggled creature have a 50% chance to target you (if you were not the original target) or another juggled creature (chosen randomly) instead of its original target. Regardless of whether or not a juggled creature is willing, they lose their Dexterity bonus to AC and are considered to be grappled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
